cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SoundKey, please cite it as below."
title: "SoundKey — an accessibility-first audio interface for Flipper Zero"
abstract: >-
  SoundKey makes common Flipper Zero functions usable by blind and low-vision
  users entirely through audio (and optional haptics), with a simplified,
  predictable, screen-free interaction model, a reusable audio-feedback
  framework, and a documented sound-cue library.
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-09-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Krishita17/soundkey-flipperzero"
authors:
